      "notes": "Onboard tactile pushbutton (SW3 on both receiver-v0.1.0 and remote-v0.1.0 hardware), GPIO3 to GND, no external pull-up (relies on RP2040 internal pull-up). Confirmed via github.com/picolume/hardware production KiCad netlists (production/netlist.ipc) for both physical PicoLume board designs — consistent GPIO assignment on both. Full digital_input/digital_output/pwm_output capability retained (ordinary GPIO wired to a switch to GND, not a dedicated/capacitive-only pin), matching this repo's adafruit_feather_scorpio PIN_BUTTON/GPIO7 precedent."
